+Leaf/Gale/Velocity protocol integer encoding
+--------------------------------------------
+
+Research snapshot: WheatLeaf/Leaf commit cc2a6fdfdec6245b9084b8860bdcbbbd7ddf04e6
+Leaf patch files: 0075-Pre-compute-VarLong-sizes.patch and
+0076-Optimize-VarInt-write-and-VarLong-write.patch
+Patch author: Martijn Muijsers, Gale
+Based on Velocity work by Andrew Steinborn
+License: GPL-3.0-only
+LeavesX modification: adapted to the 26.1.2 Paper/Folia interfaces, made configurable, and covered by byte-level
+differential tests. The LeavesX distribution includes GPL-3.0 terms in PATCHES-LICENSE.
+
+Leaf/Gale ShapePairKey hash caching
+-----------------------------------
+
+Research snapshot: WheatLeaf/Leaf commit cc2a6fdfdec6245b9084b8860bdcbbbd7ddf04e6
+Leaf patch file: 0046-Cache-ShapePairKey-hash.patch
+Patch author: Dreeam, Gale
+License: LGPL-3.0-only
+LeavesX modification: retains the cached identity hash and adds a thread-local non-stored lookup key so cache hits do
+not allocate. Persistent cache keys remain independent objects and the original LRU behavior is retained.
